  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "Oh yeah, Sean and I go way back two, three years.",
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 4.16
    },
    {
      "text": "We met deer hunting a couple years ago at a buddy Rob's cabin and we, I know ever since",
      "start": 4.9,
      "end": 10.04
    },
    {
      "text": "we've gotten out in the tree stands together, got some time in the woods, so he thought that",
      "start": 10.04,
      "end": 14.68
    },
    {
      "text": "it'd be a good idea to bring me out here and meet some new people and integrate me",
      "start": 14.68,
      "end": 18.62
    },
    {
      "text": "into his community.",
      "start": 18.62,
      "end": 19.34
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm curious about you.",
      "start": 19.96,
      "end": 20.82
    },
    {
      "text": "What's your story?",
      "start": 21.22,
      "end": 21.82
    }
  ]
